{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"はろりんごっっ(o・・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんごっ(o・・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々と書きたいことがありすぎて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何から書けばいいのかわからない松村です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しずつ書いていこうと思いますので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、どうぞお付きあいくだされ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"双方向クイズ天下統一に出演しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その日は朝から携帯をわすれ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ更新が出来なかったのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒にいた生駒たんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"親切に携帯を貸してくれました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒たんありがとう！ちゅっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の番組は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんと一緒に天下統一を目指すものやったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"参加してくださった皆様ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に惜しくも天下統一は出来なかったのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても楽しかったですか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初の自己紹介のとき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"動物の真似をしよう！って話になって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松村は「ワンっ♪」と犬の真似をしたのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相方の高山は「がぁっ！！」と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よくわからない動物の真似をしていて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よくわからなかったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松村は大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、高山の握手にいかれる方は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「動物の物真似してください！」と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言ってみてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっとかわいい「がぁっ！！」が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くると思います！松村もやってもらいたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は初登場の松村のペットも出演しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熱帯魚のベタという種類の男の子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前は「べーやん」です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっわいー＼(^^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2013/06/10/3469862/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泳ぐの好きみたいで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真とるの大変やった(>_<)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"べーやん松村にめっちゃなついてる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お話するねん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく食べる！おっちょこちょい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんはペットかってはりますの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベタはおすすめよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手間かからんの〜＼(^^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほなら、またね〜＼(^^)／"}],"source":"archive"}